-- Spatial recurrence (ex46), Version B (canonical): the recurrence runs host-side. Twin of 46-spatial-recurrence.bqn (third assertion).
-- Japanese surface: 升目の列で、各升の高さは前の二升の和となる。 fib(index) maps the registered host fn over the selection ordinal; same fixture as -a, so the differing expect also witnesses that the stencil step is not the recurrence.
--! registry ../registries/46-spatial-recurrence-a.reg
--! expect height = 1 1 2 3 5 8 13 21

Cell @ row , Height = fib(index)
